    '\n\nReply with only JSON: {"score": integer 0-10, "verdict": "one short sentence", "strengths": ["..."], "missing": ["key point they missed"], "better": "an improved answer in first person, 60-120 words, the way a strong candidate would say it", "follow_up": "the cross-question a real interviewer would ask next", "tip": "one delivery tip"}'+langRule('Write \"verdict\", \"strengths\", \"missing\" and \"tip\" in the language below. Keep \"better\" and \"follow_up\" in English, because the real interview is in English. Keep the JSON keys in English.');
